---

## Summary of Architecture

| Aspect | Detail |
|---|---|
| **Framework** | Next.js 16.x canary (App Router) with React 19.1 |
| **Routing** | File-system based: `/` (home) and `/product/[slug]` (detail) |
| **Rendering** | Server components throughout; async components with Suspense streaming |
| **Data** | Hardcoded 4-product array in `lib/products.ts` — no database/API |
| **Styling** | Plain CSS via `globals.css` — no CSS modules, no Tailwind |
| **Animations** | Only a `pulse` keyframe for skeleton loading states — **no page transitions or view transitions** |
| **Suspense** | Two boundaries: one on home (ProductGrid), one on detail (ProductDetails) |
| **Images** | None — colored `<div>` placeholders used for product visuals |
| **Loading UX** | Skeleton cards on home, skeleton text bars on detail page |
| **Tests** | Vitest is a devDependency but no test files exist |

